  "hero_headline": "AI代理时代加速演进，全球经济面临地缘与通胀双重挑战 / AI Agent Era Accelerates Amidst Global Economic and Geopolitical Headwinds",
  "daily_overview": "今日科技界聚焦AI Agent的可靠性与落地，从云原生架构到企业知识库连接，人工智能正从实验阶段迈向业务深层应用。财经层面，亚洲股市随油价攀升引发的通胀担忧而震荡，同时地缘政治摩擦进一步推高能源风险，全球贸易保护主义倾向显现。地缘政治方面，中东局势迎来10月7日冲突三周年节点，地区矛盾与人道主义危机依然紧绷，同时俄罗斯与西方的外交对话围绕公共卫生安全展开。科技创新、市场波动与地缘动荡共同构成今日全球视野的主轴。\n\nToday's tech landscape centers on the reliability and deployment of AI Agents, moving from experimental phases to deep business integration through cloud-native architectures and enterprise knowledge linkage. In finance, Asian markets are bracing for volatility as rising oil prices fuel inflation concerns, compounded by protectionist trade signals. Geopolitically, the third anniversary of the October 7th conflict highlights persistent regional tensions and humanitarian crises, while diplomatic discourse between Russia and the West shifts toward public health security. Together, these developments define a day marked by technological momentum, market instability, and geopolitical friction.",
